The level 0 book is called ".i la lojban mo". Elsewhere in the
book, full stops are added after cmevla.

Like Jorge, I prefer to omit fullstops altogether, but that is
irrelevant to a textbook that is expected to set a Good Example.

I am also opposed to omitting spaces, lest usage naturalistically
come to exapt significance into the contrast between "lenu" and 
"le nu".

